  m_text: "If you're reading this, it means I didn't make it...\n\nThere is a key
    hidden somewhere in this Clinic Villa. It opens the underground lab beneath the
    White Mansion across the hill.\n\nInside that lab lies the only vaccine that
    can stop this outbreak. I worked on it until my final breath. Please... don't
    let it go to waste.\n\nThe fate of humanity may depend on you now.\n\n\u2014
    Dr. K"
